{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574690/extras/f89fe8dcae7260603bed872d3cfc7eb0.poster.avif?t=1761929266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574690/extras/f89fe8dcae7260603bed872d3cfc7eb0.webm?t=1761929266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574690/extras/f89fe8dcae7260603bed872d3cfc7eb0.mp4?t=1761929266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A PvP FOOD FIGHTING BATTLER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the grottiest fast food restaurant in town, challenge your friends or battle strangers online in this chaotic, tongue-powered showdown! Armed with an absurdly long tongue, compete by licking as much food as you can muster to claim the golden crown in this off-the-wall licking contest!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LICK RANDOM OBJECTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your massive tongue to lick snacks, launch mystery meat, and fling utter chaos across the table. It\u2019s fast, messy, and totally unhinged! All your games in Tong are tracked in your personal stat screen, so make each one legendary!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPRAY CONDIMENTS ON STRANGERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm yourself with an arsenal of condiments! From ketchup and mustard to some of the wildest hot sauces imaginable, get utterly messy and cover your opponents in sticky chaos! Rack up XP, max out your character, and unleash total food-fight mayhem in real-time multiplayer matches.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DECORATE YOUR TONG</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a fashion statement! Unlock outrageous hats to distract, dazzle, and annoy your online rivals. Stand out, look ridiculous, and show off your style! You can even change background colours WOW!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TONS OF GROTTY ITEMS TO UNLOCK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horde a bunch of old stuff in a box.\u00a0Bog roll, old socks, scratch cards and canned tuna, you'll discover tons of bonkers items for your material needs. Study each item in compendium to outwit your rivals when the time is right!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574690?t=1761929266","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574690/835207d627fef62a0a8972c059003033f6216e07/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761929266","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574690/947973921fd960f9749e0448e92d857507c6323f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761929266","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574690/947973921fd960f9749e0448e92d857507c6323f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761929266","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574690/extras/f89fe8dcae7260603bed872d3cfc7eb0.poster.avif?t=1761929266\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.